    "input_texts": [
      "Title: Navigating Postmill navigation pitfalls\nDescription: Key UI signals and potential traps when navigating the Postmill forum structure.\n- The home page may show no posts; use the 'Forums' link to access the forum index.\n- If a direct link results in a 404 Not Found, the post may be missing or the link invalid; try navigating from the home page instead.\n- Use 'go_back' and 'go_forward' to recover from incorrect navigation paths on the forums index.\n- To reply to a specific comment, you must first enter the post's thread page by clicking the 'comments' link on the post listing.\n- The 'Reply' link is attached to individual comments, not the main post title.\n- Ensure the 'Comment' textbox in the reply form is targeted correctly before filling text.\n- The 'Post' button is specific to the reply form; do not confuse it with general site navigation buttons."
